#showas:我喜欢乌龟
Speedster AI found his favorite ally - Nanobots! 

Double-Up on planetary speed boosts for <i><b>Ludicrous Speed</i></b> AI ships warping across planets in seconds.

Be amazed as the Nanos take the entire galaxy in mere minutes.. Better get that hive early, while your Zenith Architrave allies distract everyone and provide good galaxy vision.

That said, these PARTICULAR nanos will actually reinvade after you kill their hive!

What a lost cause of a game for humanity! Just kidding! You start with a Nordian Tortoid as your Ark Flagship, so GG EZ Game.

This game features a number of mods:

Generator: a new Galaxy layout (and others) called Scatter.
Points of Interest: for some flavor, interesting unique locations (rarely) scattered across the galaxy.
Outguard Party: you can get a free Demeter's Cornucopia at your starting planet to help out the slow econ start of Ark Empire.
More System Defenders: some extra station defenses to make up for no starting battle stations.